  "content": "\n\n<h1>Liteminer</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amber-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Amber-iamkaf?style=for-the-badge&label=Requires&color=#ebb134\" alt=\"Amber\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/iamkaf/mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/iamkaf/mod-issues?style=for-the-badge&color=#eee\" alt=\"Issues\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/HV5WgTksaB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1207469438719492176?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&label=DISCORD&color=#5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fiamkaffe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/KoFi-iamkaf?style=for-the-badge&logo=kofi&logoColor=#30d1e3&label=Support Me&color=#30d1e3\" alt=\"KoFi\"></a></p>\n<p>按住快捷鍵即可開採整條礦脈、砍倒整棵樹或破壞任意方塊群組。適用於 Fabric、NeoForge、Forge 和 Quilt 的礦脈開採模組。</p>\n<p>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge Config API Port</a>。</p>\n<p>Minecraft 1.21.9 之前的版本（1.21.8 及更早版本）需要 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ftSpErY.gif\" alt=\"Liteminer 的 GIF 預覽，遊戲中正在開採鑽石與鐵礦脈。\"></p>\n<h3>使用方式</h3>\n<p>按住 ~（波浪號／反引號）鍵，看向目標方塊後進行開採。輪廓線會顯示即將開採的範圍。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/iamkaf/modresources/refs/heads/main/pages/liteminer/screenshot5.png\" alt=\"鍵盤快捷鍵\"></p>\n<p>支援多種開採形狀，按住 Liteminer 快捷鍵並滾動滑鼠滾輪即可切換。</p>\n<p>可用的形狀包括：自由形狀（開採相連方塊）、3x3、小型隧道、向上階梯與向下階梯。</p>\n<h3>目前規劃</h3>\n<p>專案啟動時設定的功能已全部實作完畢，我對目前的成果感到滿意。接下來將著重於修復可能出現的錯誤，並根據我的構想或社群需求新增新功能。</p>\n<p>感謝大家的支持！</p>\n<h3>標籤</h3>\n<h4>物品標籤</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><code>liteminer:excluded_tools</code> - 此標籤內的物品無法用於 Liteminer 開採（僅限主手欄位）</li>\n<li><code>liteminer:included_tools</code> - 若伺服器設定中 <code>require_tool</code> 為 true，預設僅允許使用「工具」類物品（具耐久度的階級物品）；此標籤可用來額外開放其他物品</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>方塊標籤</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><code>liteminer:excluded_blocks</code> - 此標籤內的方塊絕對禁止使用 Liteminer 開採</li>\n<li><code>liteminer:block_whitelist</code> - 若此標籤不為空，則<em>僅限</em>此標籤內的方塊可被 Liteminer 開採</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>注意：這些標籤與 FTB Ultimine 的標籤相容，若您已有一套滿意的設定，可直接在兩個模組間共用。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>截圖</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/iamkaf/modresources/refs/heads/main/pages/liteminer/screenshot1.png\" alt=\"開採形狀\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/iamkaf/modresources/refs/heads/main/pages/liteminer/screenshot2.png\" alt=\"開採形狀\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/iamkaf/modresources/refs/heads/main/pages/liteminer/screenshot3.png\" alt=\"開採形狀\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/iamkaf/modresources/refs/heads/main/pages/liteminer/screenshot4.png\" alt=\"開採形狀\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2b8d30774e17ff51cf5f2b257f6cb1970f826c3d_0.webp\" alt=\"Liteminer 樹木輪廓\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/079e3e003e55954eed51ede44aa3b92e50c2b1ae.png\" alt=\"Liteminer 地面輪廓\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/22ac03f14cca7375d06cba76b54141e411e6ed62.png\" alt=\"Liteminer 鑽石礦脈輪廓\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0255cf113d51e9ebec132a6d0ce0f5fa9c595da5_0.webp\" alt=\"設定畫面\"></p>\n<h2>協助翻譯 Liteminer</h2>\n<p>想協助將此模組翻譯成您的語言嗎？歡迎加入社群翻譯計畫：</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi18n.kaf.sh%252fprojects%252fliteminer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">貢獻翻譯</a></p>\n<p>🇺🇸 🇪🇸 🇧🇷 🇫🇷 🇩🇪 🇷🇺 🇹🇷 🇯🇵 🇰🇷 🇨🇳</p>\n<h2>常見問題</h2>\n<p><strong>Q: 如果有這裡沒列出的問題該怎麼辦？</strong></p>\n<p>A: 請在此 <a href=\"https://github.com/iamkaf/mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">建立問題單</a> 或加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/HV5WgTksaB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 直接傳訊給我。</p>\n<p><strong>Q: 能否移植到 [MC 版本/模組載入器]？</strong></p>\n<p>A: 如果足夠多人請求，我會撥出時間處理，但這確實是單人開發，可能需要一些時間。</p>\n<p><strong>Q: 可以將其放入我的模組包（Modpack）中嗎？</strong></p>\n<p>A: 可以，無需署名或事先詢問。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/HV5WgTksaB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/iamkaf/modresources/refs/heads/main/pages/common/discord.png\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord\"></a></p>\n<h2>更多由我開發的模組</h2>\n<table>\n<tr>\n  <td>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bonded\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/rTXmXcev/11b51387117253203afa17f0ebe563d221c0bc2c_96.webp\" alt=\"Bonded\" width=\"64\"></a><br>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bonded\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Bonded</strong></a>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gentle-hurt-cam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/WqioinYz/645237016700abc77814892b6fcbdab350918864_96.webp\" alt=\"Gentle Hurt Cam\" width=\"64\"></a><br>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gentle-hurt-cam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Gentle Hurt Cam</strong></a>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mochila\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/IWGxWQWM/69e080a8c10a2e6af74fdb418a89285ff929c0fc.png\" alt=\"Mochila\" width=\"64\"></a><br>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mochila\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mochila</strong></a>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-toss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AIYW9sHq/1da752edf297cbfb8cd916b0b02238c64afb2474_96.webp\" alt=\"Torch Toss\" width=\"64\"></a><br>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-toss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Torch Toss</strong></a>\n  </td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<h2>相容性</h2>\n<p>若發現任何問題，請隨時告訴我。</p>\n<h2>致謝</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-ultimine-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Ultimine</a> 提供本模組的開發靈感。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply Tools</a> 提供部分客戶端程式碼。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a> 提供本模組所基於的多載入器架構。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ModdingByKaupenjoe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">KaupenJoe</a> 教導我如何進行模組開發。</li>\n<li>以及最重要的，<strong>Aris</strong> 一直陪伴在我身邊。</li>\n</ul>",
